WEBVTT

00:04:59.962 --> 00:05:02.173
And yet, one third
of our world's population

00:05:02.173 --> 00:05:04.091
cannot afford a healthy diet.

00:05:05.343 --> 00:05:07.136
This is a big challenge.

00:05:08.012 --> 00:05:09.722
Now food is medicine.

00:05:10.348 --> 00:05:13.351
Healthy food gives us long
and productive lives.

00:05:13.392 --> 00:05:18.564
And during COVID,
we've seen the impact of closures,

00:05:18.606 --> 00:05:22.651
shipping challenges
that have affected food prices,

00:05:22.693 --> 00:05:27.656
and the most vulnerable have had to shift
from healthy diets to unhealthy diets

00:05:27.698 --> 00:05:29.408
because they are cheaper.

00:05:29.742 --> 00:05:33.704
This has caused more damage
to lives all over the world.